      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Repelled it, then— What manner of creature was\r\nthat queer monster?\r\nNe'er heard tell of a monster laying traps!",
        "Jp" : "なんとか撃退できたか――\r\nあの奇妙な魔物は一体何だったのだ\r\n罠を仕掛ける魔物など、聞いたこともない！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 542888,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Arisen of Lestania, my apologies.\r\nGo report to the old man near Manun Village —\r\n<NPC 2556>, was it? Him.\r\nI'll investigate the area, then return.",
