    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 20993,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "My, my— I had supposed Dana would dispatch\r\nits finest warrior...\r\nYet to think the Arisen of a foreign land, you\r\nyourself, would come...",
        "Jp" : "これはこれは――\r\nダナで一番の戦士をよこしてくれるのかと思えば\r\nまさか異国の覚者様、貴方が来てくださるとは"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 542900,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Word has it the earth rumbles nigh Dana... The\r\ncause, methinks, is that which resides in my\r\nmemory — there can be no mistaking it.",
        "Jp" : "なんでも、ダナの辺りで地鳴りが聞こえるそうですな\r\n恐らく原因はわしの記憶にある\"アレ\"で\r\n間違いありますまい"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551007,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "By rights, I would fain recount an old\r\nman's tales to you...\r\nBut a crisis draws nigh to Manun as well—",
        "Jp" : "本来ならば、この年寄りの昔話くらい\r\nこころよくお聞かせしたいところですが\r\nこのマヌンにも危機が迫っておるのです――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551008,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Twould appear the monsters that should have lain\r\nsealed within the Sacred River Ruins have, of\r\nlate, begun to stir anew.",
        "Jp" : "《聖河の遺跡》に\r\n封印されていたはずの魔物が\r\n最近、急に動き出したような気配がありまして"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551009,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "A warrior chanced to pass near, so I called to\r\nthem and bade they go ascertain the situation...\r\nyet still they have not returned—",
        "Jp" : "近くを通りがかった戦士に声をかけ\r\n様子を見てきてくれるよう頼んだのですが\r\nいまだ戻ってきておりませんでな――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551010,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Tis reasonable to surmise the seal was broken\r\nfor some reason; should that monster emerge, it\r\nmay well come to assail this cavern.",
        "Jp" : "これは、何らかの理由で\r\n封印が解けたと考えてよいでしょう\r\nかの魔物が外に出れば、この洞窟を\r\n襲いに来るやもしれませぬ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551011,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It amounts to a bargain, I fear —\r\nyet should you vanquish the monsters...\r\nI shall speak to you of the ground's rumbling.",
        "Jp" : "交換条件となってしまいますが\r\n魔物を倒してきてくだされば\r\n地鳴りについて、お話いたしましょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551012,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 2556,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Enan",
      "Jp" : "エナン"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 20994,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Should you journey to the Sacred River Ruins and\r\nvanquish the monster that appears to have\r\nawakened there, I shall impart all that lies\r\nwithin my knowledge.",
        "Jp" : "《聖河の遺跡》 で\r\n目覚めたらしき魔物を討伐してきてくだされば\r\nわしの知る限りのことをお話いたしましょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 542901,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The warrior who went before has not yet returned\r\n— I pray no ill tidings has befallen them.",
        "Jp" : "先に行った戦士もまだ戻っておりませんが――\r\n残念なことになっていなければいいのですが"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551013,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 2556,
