    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Oh, you'll go, eh?\r\nKeeps gettin' more tangled by the minute...\r\nSorry 'bout that—",
        "Jp" : "ああ、行ってくれるのかい\r\nどんどんややこしいことになっていっちまって\r\nなんだかすまないね――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516351,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Henin's the elder o' the folk in Manun Village.\r\nAny dealings with that lot, he's\r\nthe one shows up, eh?",
        "Jp" : "エナンって人は《マヌンの集落》で暮らす\r\n人たちの長老らしいよ\r\nあそこと何かやり取りをする時は\r\n大体あの人が出てくるんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551005,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What kinda valor they want shown, hell if I wit.\r\nBut you go on and give it hell, eh!",
        "Jp" : "一体どんな武勇を見せろっていうんだか\r\nわからないけど、気張って行っておくれよ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551006,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 2501,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Razanailt",
      "Jp" : "ラザネイル"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 19281,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 15,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Go to Henin, elder o' Manun Village. No clue what\r\nfeat o' arms they want, but put\r\nyour back into it, eh!",
        "Jp" : "《マヌンの集落》で暮らしてる人たちの\r\n長老、エナンって人のところに行ってくれるかい\r\n一体どんな武勇を見せろっていうんだか\r\nわからないけど、気張って行っておくれよ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516352,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 2501,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Razanailt",
      "Jp" : "ラザネイル"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 19282,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 16,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "A Lestanian Arisen—!\r\nForgive me, but lend me a hand.\r\nI intended only to observe; but it seems I've\r\nbeen ensnared in a peculiar monster's trap.",
        "Jp" : "レスタニアの覚者か――！\r\nすまないが手を貸してくれ\r\n様子を見るだけのつもりだったのだが\r\n妙な魔物の罠にはめられたようだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544014,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 17,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The talismans sustaining this barrier are nigh.\r\nDestroy them all.\r\nThen this barrier will—\r\n—Arisen! Behind you!!",
        "Jp" : "この結界を張る護符が近くにあるはずだ\r\nそれを全て破壊してくれ\r\nそうすれば、この結界が――\r\n――覚者よ、後ろだ！！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516353,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 560,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Corentin",
      "Jp" : "コランタン"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 19283,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 18,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Talismans upholding the barrier lie scattered\r\nabout;\r\nDestroy them all! \r\nOnce the barrier falls, I can fight!",
        "Jp" : "結界を張る護符が周囲にあるはずだ\r\nそれを全て破壊してくれ！\r\n結界さえ解ければ、俺も戦える！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516354,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 560,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Corentin",
      "Jp" : "コランタン"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 19284,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 19,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Unbelievable— \r\na monster that lays traps...\r\nMethinks I sense an ill portent.\r\nWe dare not lower our guard henceforth...",
        "Jp" : "なんと――罠をしかける魔物とは――\r\n何やら不穏なものを感じます\r\n今後も気は抜けませんな――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516355,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 20,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah, yes, about the rumbling of the earth—\r\nI’ve heard stories about that resounding rumbling\r\nfrom time to time for as long as I can bethink.",
        "Jp" : "そうそう、地鳴りについてですが\r\n昔から、響き渡る地鳴りについての話は\r\n時折耳にしていたものです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551020,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 21,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Such matters shall be revealed by perusing the\r\naged tomes housed in the Small Tower of Wisdom,\r\nfor there lie works of singular worth, and 'twas\r\na place where scholars once gathered—",
        "Jp" : "こういったことは《知恵の小塔》に収められた\r\n過去の書物を紐解くことで明らかとなるでしょう\r\nあそこは特に貴重な書物が収められ\r\n学者たちがつどった場所ですからの――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551022,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 22,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Twas abandoned once monster raids began, yet\r\nuntil a few years past I myself saw to its upkeep\r\nin secret. The books, too, should yet\r\nabide, fit for reading.",
        "Jp" : "魔物の襲撃を受けるようになって\r\n放棄されましたが、数年前までは\r\nわしが密かに手入れしておりました\r\n書物もまだ十分に読める状態で残っているはずです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551023,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 23,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I cannot read difficult tomes...\r\nYet I deemed them precious,\r\ncertain they would serve.\r\n'Twas for times like these, was it not?",
        "Jp" : "わしは難しい書物を読むことはできませんが\r\nきっと大切なものだろうと思ったのです\r\nこういう時のためだったのですな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551024,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
